<title>SRI LANKA: S.LANKA T-BILLS OVERSUBSCRIBED, RATES EASE.</title>
<headline>S.LANKA T-BILLS OVERSUBSCRIBED, RATES EASE.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yields of three, six and 12-month treasury bills yields fell by 0.23, 0.39 and 0.40 percentge points at Wednesday's auction, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>		   Bids received   Bids accepted   Avg yield</p>
<p>    3 months     2,820	     1,500	  10.19 (10.42)</p>
<p>    6 months     2,221	     1,250	  10.46 (10.85)</p>
<p>    12 months    2,762	     1,625	  10.72 (11.12)</p>
<p>    Total	  7,803	     4,375</p>
<p>NOTE - Bids in million rupees, yields in percent (previous week's yields in brackets).</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
